# installer/deploy.manifest
#
# Explicit deployment manifest. Every path here is relative to Configs/ in
# this repo and is deployed to the same relative path under $HOME. A path
# ending in '/' is a directory, deployed recursively file-by-file (each
# file individually backed up/skipped-if-unchanged - see deploy_one in
# installer/lib.sh). Everything else is a single file.
#
# This is intentionally NOT "copy all of Configs/". Configs/ also carries
# KDE/Dolphin/editor/shell config that must not overwrite the user's
# existing setup - see CLAUDE.md "Files that must not be changed
# automatically" and the exclusion list at the bottom of this file.

.config/hypr/
.config/uwsm/
.config/hyde/
.config/waybar/
.config/rofi/
.config/swaync/
.config/systemd/user/swaync.service.d/10-hyde-session-scope.conf
.config/systemd/user/cliphist-watch.service
.config/satty/
.config/wlogout/
.config/libinput-gestures.conf
.config/xdg-terminals.list

.local/bin/hyde-shell
.local/bin/hydectl
.local/bin/hyde-ipc
.local/bin/cliphist-watch
.local/bin/hypr-dpms
.local/bin/hypr-health
.local/bin/swaync-actions
.local/bin/battery-notify

.local/lib/hyde/

.local/share/hypr/
.local/share/hyde/
.local/share/waybar/
.local/share/wallbash/
.local/share/icons/

# --- deliberately NOT deployed (present under Configs/ but out of scope) ---
# .config/Code, .config/Code - OSS, .config/VSCodium  - editor state, user-owned
# .config/Kvantum, .config/qt5ct, .config/qt6ct        - optional Qt theming, not core
# .config/MangoHud                                      - unrelated to this fork's scope
# .config/baloofilerc, .config/dolphinrc, .config/kdeglobals - KDE/Plasma, must not touch
# .config/kio, .local/share/dolphin, .local/share/kio, .local/share/kxmlgui5 - KDE
# .config/dconf, .config/xsettingsd, .config/gtk-3.0    - desktop-wide, out of scope for now
# .config/dunst                                          - superseded by swaync (DEPENDENCIES.md)
# .config/fish, .config/vim, .config/zsh, .config/starship - shell/editor, user-owned
# .config/spotify-flags.conf, .config/code-flags.conf, .config/codium-flags.conf,
#   .config/electron-flags.conf                          - unrelated app flags
# .local/share/fastfetch                                 - optional, not required for Hyprland
# .local/share/xdg-desktop-portal                        - distro Hyprland profile is active;
#                                                         bundled override targets unavailable hypr-kdeconnect
